      "title": "pyspark-df",
      "text": "%pyspark\n# DataFrame + pandas_udf: prueba que el executor (spark-worker) tiene las\n# mismas librerias que el driver (necesario para pandas_udf/applyInPandas).\nimport pandas as pd\nfrom pyspark.sql.functions import pandas_udf\n\ndf \u003d spark.createDataFrame([(1, \"a\"), (2, \"b\"), (3, \"c\")], [\"id\", \"letra\"])\ndf.show()\n\n@pandas_udf(\"long\")\ndef mas_uno(s: pd.Series) -\u003e pd.Series:\n    return s + 1\n\ndf.select(mas_uno(df.id)).show()\nprint(\"master:\", spark.sparkContext.master)",
